<title>USA: Belmont Homes revises 1996 year earnings.</title>
<headline>Belmont Homes revises 1996 year earnings.</headline>
<dateline>BELMONT, Miss. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belmont Homes said Monday it was revising its earnings report of February 13, 1997, for the full year 1996.</p>
<p>Belmont said its actual net income for the year was $12.1 million, or $1.29 per share, instead of $12.2 million, or $1.30 a share, as reported originally.</p>
<p>The company said the revision followed from an additional $82,000 of income tax expense for the period and a $56,000 correction for subsidiary consolidations.</p>
</text>
